      "title": "The assembly\u2019s material accountability",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_5",
          "text": "Paul\u2019s commands to test oneself and discern the body occur within a passage about bread, cup, Messiah\u2019s body, assembly humiliation, sickness, and waiting for one another. The warning concerns the manner of eating and drinking, not a category of people who are intrinsically unworthy. Interpretations of illness and death in 11:30 remain contested and cannot justify blaming sick, disabled, poor, or dying people.",
